## CI Failure Resolution

| Issue | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| Format fail | Run `pnpm format` locally |
| Lint fail | Fix ESLint errors |
| Type check fail | Fix TypeScript errors |
| Build fail | Check Docker setup |
| Release PR not created | Check commit messages use conventional format |

---

## Important Notes

1. **Use squash merge** when merging PRs — this creates a single clean commit on main
2. **Merge commits** also work, but squash merge is recommended for cleaner history
3. **release-please skips `chore:` and `build:`** from changelog features section (they still trigger release)
4. **No manual version bumps** needed — release-please handles everything
